      "writtenOn": "2021-05-12T08:45:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the threading model for this mutable member (and the one below ?)\nIt\u0027s not accessed locked, and it\u0027s accessed on the handler thread in the VCN policy listener, and in some other thread (guaranteed to be different) in the constructor of NetworkAgent. That means some percentage of the time you\u0027ll see null and crash the system server in l.499.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 201,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 201,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "8d604fe6360528ab63c60f9e3ec9d7e9e96bd747",
